commit 1a9116b7
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 12:24:35 -0600
subject: feat(smart-router): score breakdown + configurable sticky TTL + source-app fingerprinting

- resolveSmartRouter returns top-N scores (model + score) for a 'why did it pick X' panel; threaded via smartRouterMeta through chatCore → saveUsageStats → usageHistory.meta
- stickyTtlMin setting (default 5, 1-1440) honored by sticky session cache; UI input in Smart Router card
- sourceApps.js: UA → stable source-app class (privacy: never stores raw UA); persisted on requestDetails
- 41 related unit tests pass


